                                            consider and, if thought appropriate, pass, with or without variation, a special resolution
                                            to change the name of the Corporation to &ldquo;A2Z Cust2Mate Solutions Corp.&rdquo; or such
                                            other name as may be approved by the directors of the Corporation and may be acceptable to
                                            regulatory authorities, as more fully described in the Circular; and</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

