of Shares Owned</B></FONT></P> <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: center"></P> <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>(Percentage
                                            of Class and Type of Ownership)</B></FONT></P></TD><TD><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</FONT></TD></TR>
