    to a Participant shall, if such Participant has entered into a service or employment agreement with the Company or an Affiliate that
    is in effect, have the meaning given to the term in that agreement, or, if no such agreement exists, or if &ldquo;Good Reason&rdquo;
    is not defined therein, then Good Reason means:</FONT></TD></TR>
